All models use \tbf{200}-dimensional embeddings and GRU layers with \tbf{500} hidden units.
The dropout probability $P_{drop}$ is used for all 3 dropouts and set to 0.2 and 0.3 for EN\ra TR and TR\ra EN respectively.
The validation BLEU is computed after each $\sim$1/4 epoch and the training stops if no
improvement is achieved after 20 consecutive validations.

